{"speciesId":507,"names":{"fr":"Ponchien","es":"Herdier","en":"Herdier","ja":"ハーデリア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les poils qui entourent son corps comme un manteau sont extrêmement durs et amortissent les coups."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il obéit fidèlement aux consignes. Il assiste les Dresseurs depuis très longtemps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It loyally follows its Trainer’s orders. For ages, they have helped Trainers raise Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon très loyal qui aide aussi bien les Dresseurs que les autres Pokémon qu’il rencontre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este Pokémon es muy leal. No solo ayuda a Entrenadores, sino que también se preocupa por otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"トレーナーを 助けながら 他の ポケモンの 世話もする とても 忠実な ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les poils qui entourent son corps comme un manteau sont extrêmement durs et amortissent les coups."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un robusto pelaje cubre su cuerpo a modo de capa y disminuye el daño que recibe en los ataques."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"マントのように 体を 覆う 黒い 体毛は とても 硬い。 受けた ダメージを 減らしてくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon très loyal qui aide aussi bien les Dresseurs que les autres Pokémon qu’il rencontre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon es muy leal. No solo ayuda a Entrenadores, sino que también se preocupa por otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"トレーナーを 助けながら 他の ポケモンの 世話もする とても 忠実な ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les poils qui entourent son corps comme un manteau sont extrêmement durs et amortissent les coups."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un robusto pelaje cubre su cuerpo a modo de capa y disminuye el daño que recibe en los ataques."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It has black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"マントのように 体を 覆う 黒い 体毛は とても 硬い。 受けた ダメージを 減らしてくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Son poil long et très dur, pousse à une vitesse ahurissante, et son toilettage coûte un bras. Une plaie à élever."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El recio y oscuro pelaje que le cubre el lomo crece tan rápido que mantenerlo corto resulta de lo más caro."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its dense black fur grows continuously. The high cost of keeping its hard fur properly groomed makes this a troublesome Pokémon to train."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"黒い 体毛は とても 硬くて どんどん 伸びる。 トリミング代が かかって 大変な ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est entièrement dévoué aux ordres de son maître. En revanche, il n’obéira jamais à quelqu’un qu’il considère comme inférieur à lui."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Obedece sin rechistar las órdenes de su dueño. Ahora bien, ignora sin pudor a todo aquel que considere inferior."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon obeys its master’s orders faithfully. However, it refuses to listen to anything said by a person it doesn’t respect."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"主の 命令に 忠実。 だが 下に みている 相手の いうことは 絶対に 聞かない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son pelage sombre devient si robuste au fil du temps que même des crocs ou des griffes peinent à passer au travers."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Con el paso del tiempo, su oscuro pelaje se vuelve duro y resistente, lo que le sirve como ligera protección contra colmillos y cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The longer its black fur grows, the harder and more impervious it gets. Claws and fangs can’t easily penetrate it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"黒い 体毛は 育つほど 硬く 丈夫に なって ツメや キバも 簡単には 通さないぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cela fait si longtemps que ce Pokémon vit en harmonie avec les humains qu’il apparaît même sur des peintures rupestres antiques."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ha convivido mucho tiempo con los humanos, como atestiguan las pinturas rupestres donde aparece representado."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It has been living with people for so long that portrayals of it can be found on the walls of caves from long, long ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"大昔の 壁画に 姿が 描かれているほど 長い 間 人と 暮らしを ともに してきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon est très intelligent et affectueux. Une théorie avance qu’il aurait été le premier à devenir le partenaire d’un être humain."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es muy inteligente y cariñoso. Existen ciertas teorías que lo consideran el primer Pokémon que se convirtió en compañero de los humanos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Herdier is a very smart and friendly Pokémon. So much so that there’s a theory that Herdier was the first Pokémon to partner with people."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"とても 賢く よく 懐く。 はじめて 人のパートナーに なった ポケモンと いう 説も あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les poils sombres qui recouvrent son dos sont si épais et si souples qu’ils peuvent même repousser des crocs acérés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El pelaje negro que lo recubre es tan denso y elástico que puede repeler incluso los colmillos más afilados."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The black fur that covers this Pokémon’s body is dense and springy. Even sharp fangs bounce right off."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体を 覆う 黒い 毛は ぶ厚く 弾力が ある。 するどい キバも 弾き返すぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":507,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"level-up",29],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",29],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",29],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",29],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",29],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",29],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",54]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave",